WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Developers” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A request without a key
We run a GET for customers without Authorization; the server returns HTTP 401 because the key is missing or incorrect.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A request with missing data
We run a POST for customers with a training key and an empty body; the server returns HTTP 400 and explains that phone and name are required.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Review the limits and fix the request
Use Bearer with a single space and then the correct key, and send the required fields. On 429 wait for the Retry-After duration; we don't use up the request limit in this recording.
